{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-05-13 08:00:00', 'title': 'AIRCRAFT TECHNICIANS AT HORIZON AIR RATIFY NEW TWO-YEAR CONTRACT', 'text': 'SEATTLE, MAY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HORIZON AIR AIRCRAFT TECHNICIANS AND FLEET SERVICE AGENTS, WHO ARE REPRESENTED BY THE AIRCRAFT MECHANICS FRATERNAL ASSOCIATION (AMFA), HAVE RATIFIED A NEW TWO-YEAR CONTRACT. THE CONTRACT WAS APPROVED BY 91% OF THOSE EMPLOYEES WHO VOTED.'}